  "observations": [
    "WaitForAsideReadiness is called by StartupBrowserCreatorImpl launch after assigning profile; second RequestStartupReadinessGate only when process_startup is true",
    "RequestStartupReadinessGate sets state1 and deadline now+10000000 microseconds",
    "CheckStartupReadiness polls250000 microseconds and permits success when both extensions ready plus healthy, or when extension readiness is true on timeout",
    "Extensions missing on timeout transition state3 and callbacks false; success transition2 and callbacks true",
    "Actual readiness resolves named ExtensionRegistry factory16a186c and checks both IDs in map at0x80. Factory vtablee109478+0x80 resolves BuildService2c81db8, allocating216bytes and calling constructor2c81de0. Constructor initializes six24byte maps at8/0x20/0x38/0x50/0x68/0x80. Matching upstream fieldorder identifies the sixth as ready_extensions.",
    "Profile regular-type predicate reads actual SupportsUserData browser profile type0, matching current profile_metrics API"
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Static recovery, not runtime evidence",
    "Fixed bundled source replaces component updater activation in localdevelopment; no hosted update work",
    "Original account/password gate remains separate and still blocks normal browsing while locked or unconfigured",
    "Public-key authentication and CDP still require actual original authority; this change grants no runtime acceptance",
    "CDP listener late recovery after key-load failure remains unverified"
